  "title": "Sally P NDE 4576",
  "date": "12/20/73",
  "content": "Contacted doctor because of swelling in upper leg which would not shrink nor go away - examined by internist and surgeon - diagnosed femoral hernia - surgery 2:00 pm. Woke at midnight to find three nurses in room - oxygen mask, IV etc. Very soon, out of body, watching nurses work on my body. Then I was in an unrecognizable 'place', feeling very comfortable, not concerned or worried. Felt 'presence' and feeling I could communicate, but not speech nor hearing. My overwhelming and only concern was that although the feeling of love and peace was enormous, I needed to return to earth to raise my daughters of seven and four. What came back from the presence was, 'Whatever you need to do you will do.' That made me feel even more relaxed. I enjoyed staying a while longer and feeling the overwhelming love flood over me. I woke up in the morning in my body in the hospital bed. Many times since, I've wanted to return to that place of love and confirmation. I learned that every human's belief in a supreme being is real and that EVERYONE goes to heaven, paradise, whatever. God's forgiveness truly does pass any human understanding and hell does not exist except of our own making. Since my NDE, I have shared with bereaved friends and strangers, lost my parents and my only younger brother (whom I'm sure that I'll see again), heard almost countless stories of other NDEs, consoled parents who've lost children in devastating ways, and tried to confirm others' hopes of an afterlife. The freedom of a soul released from a body is wonderful.",
